    "body": "Completes the web side of receipt-backed expense funding during job publication.\n\n- adds an optional `expenseBudget` field (0–10,000 PLN) to the create-job form\n- sends the expense budget through the existing idempotent publish-with-payment request\n- clearly separates worker compensation from purchase/material reimbursement in the UX\n- clarifies that publication funding secures compensation + expense budget while platform fees apply only to compensation\n\nNo backend/Flyway change is required: the existing job-expense smoke already verifies that `price + expenseBudget` drives publication funding, partial wallet reservation and cancellation recovery, while labor and expense escrows remain separate after job creation.\n\nDo not merge until all latest-head required checks are green.",
